# Procurement Workflow

## End-to-End Workflow

```mermaid
flowchart TD

    Start([START])

    Create[Employee: Create Purchase Request]
    AIStandardize[AI: Standardize Purchase Request]
    Validate[System: Validate PR]
    Complete{Information Complete?}
    Revise[Employee: Revise Purchase Request]
    Submit[Employee: Submit Purchase Request]

    Review[Authorized Approver: Review Purchase Request]
    Decision{Approval Decision}

    Approve[Approve]
    Reject[Reject]
    RequestRevision[Request Revision]

    Budget[Finance: Budget Check]
    BudgetDecision{Within Budget?}

    Quotations[Procurement: Collect Quotations]
    Compare[AI: Compare Quotations]
    Recommend[AI: Provide Recommendation]
    Select[Procurement: Select Supplier]

    PO[Create Purchase Order]
    Receive[Receive Goods / Services]
    Close[Close Purchase Request]

    End([END])

    Start --> Create
    Create --> AIStandardize
    AIStandardize --> Validate
    Validate --> Complete

    Complete -->|No| Revise
    Revise --> AIStandardize

    Complete -->|Yes| Submit
    Submit --> Review
    Review --> Decision

    Decision -->|Approve| Approve
    Decision -->|Reject| Reject
    Decision -->|Request Revision| RequestRevision

    Approve --> Budget
    Reject --> End

    RequestRevision --> Revise

    Budget --> BudgetDecision
    BudgetDecision -->|Yes| Quotations
    BudgetDecision -->|No| End

    Quotations --> Compare
    Compare --> Recommend
    Recommend --> Select
    Select --> PO
    PO --> Receive
    Receive --> Close
    Close --> End
